  "version": "0.17.0-alpha.7",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.7 - 2026-06-30\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a Rich Text type filter and more accurate Link and Code tags across History, Quick Panel, and search (#1197)\n- Let `uniclip search` filter results by source device using a device name or device id (#1208)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Avoid duplicate mobile clipboard entries when the same content is re-encoded during sync (#1159)\n- Keep file clipboard entries displayed as files instead of raw `file://` text (#1205)\n- Keep the newest History card active when a new item is added at the top of the list (#1204)\n- Make code preview scrollbars easier to see and use (#1196)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.7 - 2026-06-30\n\n### Features\n\n- 在历史记录、快捷面板和搜索中加入富文本类型筛选，并让链接和代码标签更准确 (#1197)\n- `uniclip search` 现在可以用设备名或设备 id 按来源设备筛选结果 (#1208)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 避免移动端同步时因同一内容被重新编码而产生重复剪贴板记录 (#1159)\n- 文件剪贴板记录会继续按文件显示，而不是显示为原始的 `file://` 文本 (#1205)\n- 当新记录出现在历史列表顶部时，最新的第一张卡片会保持选中状态 (#1204)\n- 代码预览的滚动条现在更容易看见和操作 (#1196)",
